.TH ESL-CALIBRATE 1 "March 2026" "ecoSignalLab 0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
esl-calibrate \- calibration utilities for drift and pressure-chain checks
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B esl calibrate check
.B \-\-tone
.I tone.wav
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Compute calibration drift relative to expected dBFS reference and report
optional precision pressure-chain estimates when full analog-chain metadata
is provided.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-calibration\fR \fIPATH\fR
Calibration YAML/JSON profile.
.TP
\fB\-\-dbfs-reference\fR \fIDBFS\fR
Expected tone level in dBFS.
.TP
\fB\-\-spl-reference-db\fR \fIDB\fR
Reference SPL for offset mapping.
.TP
\fB\-\-mic-sensitivity-mv-pa\fR \fIMV_PER_PA\fR
Microphone sensitivity metadata.
.TP
\fB\-\-preamp-gain-db\fR \fIDB\fR
Analog preamp gain metadata.
.TP
\fB\-\-adc-full-scale-vrms\fR \fIVRMS\fR
ADC full-scale RMS voltage metadata.
.TP
\fB\-\-max-drift-db\fR \fIDB\fR
Absolute drift threshold for pass/fail.
.TP
\fB\-\-history\fR \fIPATH\fR
Optional history CSV append path.
.TP
\fB\-\-out\fR \fIPATH\fR
Output report JSON.
.SH NOTES
Precision \fBPa <-> dBFS\fR conversion requires:
\fBmic_sensitivity_mv_pa\fR, \fBpreamp_gain_db\fR, and
\fBadc_full_scale_vrms\fR.
.SH EXAMPLE
.B esl calibrate check --tone calib/1k_94db.wav --calibration examples/calibration.yaml --out calib/check_report.json
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR esl (1)
